The system's store name starts with the distribution's ID (nyxos-system-HOST-VERSION),
not always nixos-system.

--- a/nixos/modules/system/activation/top-level.nix
+++ b/nixos/modules/system/activation/top-level.nix
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@
